# Build config for the GitHub Pages bundle (`npm run build:pages`).
#
# VITE_API_ORIGIN is the public HTTPS origin of your home server, e.g.
# https://videoscroll.duckdns.org. Leave it empty to publish a demo-only site
# that plays the three bundled reels with no sign-in.
#
# CI overrides this with the repository variable of the same name: Vite reads
# prefixed variables from the environment after this file.
#
# NOTE: whatever goes here is public. It reveals the server's hostname, though
# every API route and media file behind it requires sign-in.
VITE_API_ORIGIN=
